der were removed. The Steam brand identifies Valve’s distribution platform, not authorship of any listed game.","Access type","unavailable","access","section","Platform listing is not game source — Complete source must be verified separately for each game; a Steam listing does not supply it.","service","demo",[77],{"_57":78,"_25":79,"_80":81},"Browse games on Steam","https://store.steampowered.com/","note","Game storefront. Check each product's release status, supported systems, and acquisition requirements; this is not an embedded browser demo.","tutorial",[84],{"_57":85,"_25":86,"_80":87},"Steamworks getting started","https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/gettingstarted","Official publishing workflow covering partner setup, builds, store presence, and release review.","Source reviewed","2026-10-20","verified","metadata","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[98,99],"dimensions","2D","3D","Development stages",[103],"stages","Build & release","Topics",[107,108,109],"tags","Publishing","Game discovery","Desktop games","Further reading",[112,113],{"_57":78,"_25":79},{"_57":85,"_25":86},"Project source",[116],{"_57":114,"_25":63},"Why it belongs here","Valve's Steam storefront distributes released games; Steamworks is the developer portal for onboarding, store presence, build uploads, testing, and updates. Publishing requires partner setup and review of the store page and build. A Coming Soon page, a demo, and a released game are different states. Steam availability does not establish AI authorship or public game source.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Community","Category","Game production","category","lead","summary","name","production","community",[144,145],{"_82":139,"_75":140,"_32":141},[107,108,109],[138],[136,137],"2d","3d","ship",{"_57":85,"_25":86,"_17":82,"_80":87},{"_57":78,"_25":79,"_17":74,"_80":81},{"_57":142,"_17":70,"_80":143},"Platform listing is not game source","Complete source must be verified separately for each game; a Steam listing does not supply i